      "help_en": "A JSON-formatted string representing an array of objects specifying skill levels for skill groups. Each array element is an object containing two fields: skillGroupId and skillLevel. Set skillGroupId to the ID of the skill group you want to modify, and set skillLevel to the desired skill level, which must be an integer from 1 to 10. A lower value indicates stronger business capability and the ability to handle more calls per unit time",
